    "causal_summary": "system-skilled-bots is the single public advisor identity for four modes over file-defined headless bots. author writes or edits a BOT.md from the shipped template. run starts a bot, queues or drains run requests and answers a needs-you item. schedule installs or removes a cron bot's launchd schedule, held disabled until enabled, and pauses, resumes, enables or disables a bot. status reads installed bots, last runs, deliveries and the needs-you inbox. The hub holds no per-mode logic: hub-router.json selects the mode, and mode-registry.json maps it to its packet. Every signal names a bot, so bare run, schedule and status phrasing does not reach the hub.",
